        "edit": "Replaced the incorrect sum assignment `assign s=(a|b|ci);` with the correct full-adder XOR sum `assign s=(a^b^ci);`. The carry logic was already correct; only the sum expression was wrong (OR instead of XOR), which caused the observed value mismatches.",
